=== lock_device map[deviceId:1]
isError: false
--- text
{
  "appConnected": false,
  "deviceId": 1,
  "expiresAt": "<time>",
  "owner": "mcp:alice:<session>"
}

=== stop_app map[bundleId:1 deviceId:1]
isError: false
--- text
stopped com.x.android

=== stop_app map[bundleId:1 clearData:true deviceId:1]
isError: false
--- text
stopped com.x.android and cleared its data

